## 8. Skema Database (Zero Data Loss Migration)

Seluruh data existing di tabel `insiden` tetap aman. Migrasi otomatis (`modules/event-notification/setup.php` — idempotent `CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS` & `ALTER TABLE` aman) akan menambahkan:

1. **Penambahan kolom pada tabel `insiden`** (jika belum ada):
   - `victim_secured_status` (`ENUM('Ya','Tidak Ada Korban','Belum')`), `victim_secured_notes` (`TEXT`)
   - `scene_secured_status` (`ENUM('Ya','Belum')`), `scene_secured_checklist` (`JSON` / `TEXT`)
   - `incident_level` (`TINYINT` 1–5), `is_vital_behavior` (`TINYINT(1)`), `is_demr_category` (`TINYINT(1)`)
   - `reported_by_name` (`VARCHAR(160)`), `reported_by_contact` (`VARCHAR(60)`), `source_channel` (`ENUM('Internal','Public QR')`)
   - `domino_json` (`LONGTEXT` — menyimpan 5 blok Model Efek Domino)
   - `structured_analysis_json` (`LONGTEXT` — menyimpan hasil Fishbone, 5-Why, ICAM, Gap Analysis, FTA)
   - `external_handling_json` (`LONGTEXT` — menyimpan data pihak eksternal, spokesperson, dokumen)
2. **Tabel Relasi Baru:**
   - `insiden_investigation_team` (`id`, `id_insiden`, `role_type` [Supervisor / Manager / Ahli K3 / Perwakilan Karyawan / Orang Terlibat], `member_name`, `badge_no`, `position`, `department`, `notes`)
   - `insiden_communications` (`id`, `id_insiden`, `user_id`, `sender_name`, `sender_role`, `channel_type` [Internal / Escalation / External], `message`, `attachment_path`, `created_at`)
   - `insiden_capa_actions` (`id`, `id_insiden`, `action_type` [Containment / Corrective / Preventive], `domino_link`, `description`, `pic_name`, `due_date`, `status` [Open / In Progress / Closed], `evidence_note`, `completed_at`)

